From c2569a03df8d752237bd392b8f23fbc251fe949e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local <local@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 00:10:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 32/34] WP20: Self sign-up page with Google Ads conversion
 import

Integration with WP18: the sign-up schema (seven user_account columns, the unique e-mail index, consent_texts and ad_click) moved from db.SCHEMA and ADDED_COLUMNS into App/app/migrations/0003_signup.sql. The onboarding_emails_opt_out columns are defined once, by WP12 in the baseline; WP20's duplicate entries were dropped. The sign-up checkbox writes user_account.onboarding_emails_opt_out, which WP12's lifecycle_mail.is_opted_out and Settings toggle read (new tests in tests/test_signup.py). Other conflicts: config.py keeps WP09's PRIVACY_VERSION 1.6; mail.py and tests/test_claim_mail.py keep WP12's lifecycle kinds and WP20's sign-up kinds, plus LIFECYCLE_KINDS; retention._delete_workspace deletes lifecycle_mail_sent and ad_click rows, audit with plain =; Settings context keeps onboarding_emails and ad_consents; routes/legal.py keeps WP09's privacy context and WP20's signup_ads_notice; privacy.html section 7 shows the cookie table, the Umami block and then the sign-up paragraphs; landing.html keeps the signup_href switch with WP09's login_click event on the /login fallback; pricing.html keeps WP09's contact_click and adds WP20's sign-up button.

Cross-WP fixes: the Google Ads recipient on /subprocessors (WP09) is listed only while UBYHOST_SIGNUP_ENABLED is on (routes/legal.py recipient_ids(), test updated). WP11's funnel hook is filled: stages signed_up and email_verified, and a signup_source_present column (UTM label or ad click), with EN and CS labels and a new test.

mail_notify.py: WP23's filing watchdog builders kept before the sign-up section.
